'''Dungeon''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2019 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is dark gray with red tints with a stone-like texture over it. The edge of the blade is a lighter shade of gray, also with red tints. The guard is solid black, and the handle is wrapped up in brown tape.

